
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fff7f5">
<title>Andi & Putri | Wedding Invitation</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Great+Vibes&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --pink: #e8b7bd;
  --rose: #b86f7c;
  --sage: #74866c;
  --cream: #fff8f4;
  --dark: #51433f;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
  font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--dark);
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

button, input, textarea, select { font: inherit; }

button, a { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }

.cover {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 25px;
  color: white;
  background:
    linear-gradient(#49332d70, #49332d88),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519741497674-611481863552?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85')
    center/cover;
  transition: opacity 1s ease, visibility 1s ease;
}

.cover.closed {
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  pointer-events: none;
}

.cover .small {
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.cover h1 {
  font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  font-size: clamp(65px, 12vw, 105px);
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 15px 0;
  animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}

.cover p { max-width: 340px; }

button, .btn {
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  background: var(--rose);
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: inline-block;
  transition: .3s;
}

button:hover, .btn:hover {
  transform: translateY(-2px);
  opacity: .9;
}

.cover button {
  background: white;
  color: var(--rose);
  margin-top: 24px;
}

main { display: none; overflow: hidden; }

.hero {
  min-height: 90vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 70px 20px;
  background:
    linear-gradient(#fff7f2a6, #fff7f2d9),
    url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497250681960-ef046c08a56e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80')
    center/cover;
}

h1, h2, .script {
  font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.hero h1, .script { color: var(--rose); }

.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(65px, 13vw, 100px); }

h2 {
  font-size: 49px;
  line-height: 1.4;
  color: var(--rose);
  margin: 10px 0 20px;
}

h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.flower {
  font-size: 30px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  color: var(--rose);
}

section { padding: 75px 20px; }

section:nth-child(even) { background: #fff0ed; }

.container { max-width: 900px; margin: auto; }

.intro { max-width: 570px; margin: auto; }

.card {
  background: #fffdf9;
  border: 1px solid #f0d9d5;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 28px 22px;
  max-width: 570px;
  margin: 25px auto;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px #80544b0a;
}

.names {
  font: 42px 'Great Vibes', cursive;
  color: var(--rose);
}

.portrait {
  width: min(100%, 250px);
  height: 300px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 150px 150px 15px 15px;
  margin: 20px auto;
  display: block;
}

.countdown {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 25px auto;
}

.time {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid #f0d9d5;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 12px;
  min-width: 72px;
}

.time strong { display: block; font-size: 24px; color: var(--rose); }

.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 25px auto;
}

.gallery img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 250px;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.gallery img:first-child {
  grid-column: span 2;
  height: 310px;
}

.date {
  font: 25px 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin: 12px 0;
}

.bank {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #fbe9e7);
  border: 1px solid #ead2cf;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 24px 18px;
  margin: 20px auto;
  max-width: 420px;
}

.bank-logo {
  font: 600 22px 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.account {
  font-size: 22px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin: 12px 0;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

form { max-width: 500px; margin: 20px auto; }

input, textarea, select {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #e6ceca;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 13px;
  margin: 7px 0;
  color: var(--dark);
}

textarea { resize: vertical; }

.guest {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
  text-align: left;
  margin: 12px auto;
  max-width: 500px;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.guest strong { color: var(--rose); }

footer {
  padding: 45px 20px;
  background: #52654f;
  color: white;
}

footer .script { color: white; font-size: 53px; }

.reveal {
  opacity: 0;
  transform: translateY(25px);
  transition: opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease;
}

.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

@keyframes float {
  0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
}

@media(max-width:480px) {
  section { padding: 60px 17px; }
  .gallery img { height: 180px; }
  .gallery img:first-child { height: 230px; }
  .card { padding: 23px 16px; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- COVER PEMBUKA -->
<div class="cover" id="cover">
  <p class="small">THE WEDDING OF</p>
  <div class="flower">❀</div>
  <h1>Andi &amp; Putri</h1>
  <p>Kepada Yth. Bapak/Ibu/Saudara/i</p>
  <p style="margin-top:8px">Dengan penuh kebahagiaan, kami mengundang Anda untuk hadir di hari istimewa kami.</p>
  <button onclick="bukaUndangan()">✉ Buka Undangan</button>
</div>

<main id="main">

<!-- PEMBUKA -->
<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">WE ARE GETTING MARRIED</p>
  <div class="flower">❀</div>
  <h1>Andi &amp; Putri</h1>
  <p>20 Desember 2026</p>
  <div class="flower">❦</div>
  <p>Dua hati, satu janji, selamanya dalam cinta.</p>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('mempelai').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})">
